              The set 2.0 has six clip-on tubes, two each rated at 10, 15 and 20 kg, which is 22, 33 and 44 lb, for a combined 90 kg, described as about 200 lb. Band tension rises as the band stretches, so the load you feel depends on your height and the exercise. It will not feel like a 90 kg barbell.
